# Visual brand

Use this system for every new screen, component, and piece of copy. Do not revert to the old cream/teal palette or the book-mark SVG.

## Colors

- Forest green: `#294634` (primary / `--brand`), `#3B563F` (`--brand-soft`)
- Gold: `#CB9F64` (`--brand-accent`); pale gold wash `#F3E6D0` (`--gold`)
- Light gray / white: `#F3F4F2` (`--background`), `#FFFFFF` (`--surface`)
- Body text: `#333333`; muted: `#5E6B63`
- Header/footer: dark green with gold navigation and gold primary buttons

## Type

- Headings (`h1`–`h6` and display titles): **Poppins**, weight 700, tight tracking (`-0.035em`). Use the `font-heading` class. Geometric rounded sans in the Medora wordmark style — not Nunito, not serif.
- Body, forms, and UI chrome: Nunito. Arabic: Noto Sans Arabic.
- Do not force headings to lowercase; keep readable sentence case.

## Modern layout

- Keep the current green/gold/gray theme. Prefer white surfaces on light gray, compact card radius (`--radius-card`), and clear hierarchy.
- Logo is `/brand/logo.png` (Al Haramain Schools wordmark, native 253×96). Place it directly on the green header/footer with no white plate. In the site header, pin it to the top of the green bar with ~10px inset (`top-2.5` on a 65px bar), natural 96px height on `sm+`, so it hangs ~40px below like alharamainschools.co.uk. Do not top-align an oversized mark from a mid-bar spacer. Do not add a duplicate name beside it.
- Header auth is Login only (gold). Registration is reached from the login screen. Do not restore a header Get started button.
- Do not restore the cream promo strip under the header.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<h1 className="font-extrabold font-sans">Find a teacher</h1>

// ✅ GOOD
<h1 className="font-heading font-bold tracking-tight text-brand">
  Find a teacher
</h1>
```
